QuestGuidance.Register("en",309,{
[9857]="70000097\n1\tTalk to Vitharr\tThe unguarded Arming-cave is located near to the large statue of Thorin that looks out over the valley from the north-west of Frerin's Court. Unnarr has asked you to learn what became of Vitharr, the guard assigned to the presently unguarded Arming-cave.\n2\tTalk to Guard-captain Unnarr\tUnnarr, the Captain of the Guard, can be found at Frerin's Court. You found the missing guard, Vitharr, inside the Arming-cave, practically unconscious. Vitharr asked you to return to Unnarr and report that someone had assaulted him from behind and looted the Arming-cave.\n",
[9858]="70000E08\n1\tFind stolen Longbeard gold\tThe old Dourhand city lies to the west of Noglond, up a flight of steps carved into the mountains. Rothgar has confirmed the existence of an old stronghold of the Dourhands, now goblin-infested, near Noglond. If the thrushes are correct, the Dourhands brought the stolen gold into the city.\n2\tBring stolen Longbeard gold to Rothgar\tRothgar is at Noglond, east of the old Dourhand city, along the road that runs through the Vale of Thráin. You have recovered the stolen gold and should return it to Rothgar for delivery, as Dwalin instructed.\n",
[9859]="70000172\n1\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur\tFind Barliman Butterbur in the Prancing Pony, a well-known tavern in Bree-town. He may know of Strider's current whereabouts or if he's even in Bree-land at this time.\n",
[9860]="70000D4B\n1\tAcquire the skull\tThe skull is in a cave at the bottom of the quarry. Workers in the quarry at Scary uncovered a skull in the cave there, and many believe it could be the reason that spiders have overrun the quarry. Wilcome Tunnelly has asked you to bring the skull up to the surface so he can have a look at it.\n2\tBring the skull to Wilcome Tunnelly\tWilcome Tunnelly is in Scary, at the edge of the quarry. Wilcome Tunnelly is waiting for you to return with the skull his workers uncovered in the quarry at Scary.\n3\tBring Golfimbul's skull to Brombard Foxtail\tBrombard Foxtail is the keeper of the Mathom-house at Michel Delving, far to the south-west of Scary. You recovered the skull from the quarry cave, but Wilcome Tunnelly thinks it will be safest for all if it is kept in the same place as the famed club of Bandobras 'Bullroarer' Took. Wilcome has asked you to take the skull to Brombard Foxtail.\n",
[9861]="70000174\n1\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur\tThe Man called Butterbur runs a tavern called the Prancing Pony in the town of Bree. Halros has asked you to speak with a Man named Butterbur in order to discern the captain's whereabouts.\n",
[9862]="700000A4\n1\tTalk to Wíli to the West of Frerin's Court\tNoglond can be found far to the south of Thorin's Hall. The stable-master Wíli can be found in the west end of Frerin's Court. Dwalin wants you to seek out Nos Grimsong, one of his loyal retainers and a friend to the thrushes of the Vale of Thráin. If the thrushes saw the Dourhand burglars, Nos will have heard about it. Dwalin instructed you to take a horse from Frerin's court to the outpost of Noglond. Once there you are to speak to Rothgar.\n2\tTalk to Rothgar in Noglond\tWíli is in the west end of Frerin's Court. Wíli told you to travel to Noglond by way of one of his horses and to speak with Rothgar when you arrive there.\n3\tFind Nos Grimsong\tNos Grimsong is at the Thrushstones, north-west of Noglond. Rothgar told you seek Nos Grimsong and see if he has heard anything from the thrushes about the Dourhands robbing the dwarf-treasury.\n4\tBring Nos Grimsong's notes to Rothgar\tRothgar is in Noglond, to the south-east. Nos Grimsong wrote down what he learned from the thrushes about the movements of the Dourhands in recent days and gave you his notes to take to Rothgar.\n",
[9863]="70003231\n1\tDefeat Pampraush\030Defeat Blue-crag Defiler (total: 6)\030Defeat Blue-crag Sentinel (total: 4)\tPampraush and his minions are in Limael's Vineyard, north-west of Celondim. The apparent death of Avorthal has enraged Cardavor against the goblins. He has asked you to seek out a band of goblins led by a creature named Pampraush and slay them all in Avorthal's name.\n2\tTalk to Cardavor\tCardavor is at Celondim, the harbour south-east of Limael's Vineyard. You sought out the goblin Pampraush and his minions as Cardavor requested, but learned from Pampraush that Avorthal may still be alive as a prisoner of dwarves. Cardavor should be told at once.\n",
[9864]="70003268\n1\tTalk to Langlas and rescue Avorthal\tLanglas is at the hunter's lodge, east of Gondamon. Langlas told you to return to him to assist in the raid on the Dourhand camp.\n2\tTalk to Langlas\tLanglas is at the hunter's lodge, east of Gondamon. Though you and Langlas fought to the heart of the Dourhand encampment, you learned that Avorthal had already been moved. Now you and Langlas must devise another plan.\n",
[9865]="70000173\n1\tEnter the ruins of the old Marshwater Fort\tReniolind can be found in the old Marshwater Fort, which lies at the centre of the Midgewater Marshes, west of the Mustering Cave. Mundol asked that you warn the last of the Rangers in the Midgewater Marshes, Reniolind, a young scholar, of Amdir's betrayal.\n2\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur\tBarliman Butterbur can be found in the common room of The Prancing Pony Inn in Bree-town. With Reniolind's dying breaths, he asked you to find his chieftain, Strider. He instructed you to speak with Barliman Butterbur, the proprietor of The Prancing Pony Inn in Bree, to learn where Strider may be found.\n",
[9866]="7000014C\n1\tTalk to Bounder Primstone\tBounder Primstone is inside the watch house in Brockenborings. With your help, Ranger Halros has learned that the goblins have two camps north of the Greenfields and that their leader is receiving orders from a mysterious figure who is not a goblin. He has asked you to warn Bounder Primstone of this threat at once.\n2\tTalk to Wilcome Tunnelly\tWilcome Tunnelly is at the quarry in Scary, down the road east of Brockenborings. Bounder Primstone is unhappy enough with the discovery of the goblins, but to add to his troubles, he also heard that a skull was uncovered at the quarry in Scary and is worried about talk of it being Golfimbul's head spreading to other towns in the Shire. He has asked you to find out what is going on from Wilcome Tunnelly.\n",
[9867]="7000322B\n1\tSpeak to Athal at the Elf camp near Nen Hilith\tThe dwarf, Athal, who Avorthal considers a friend, has to come to the vale of Nen Hilith to speak with Avorthal. Athal is likely waiting for Avorthal at the camp to the south-west near Nen Hilith. Cardavor hopes that his son was only delayed by a visit with his dwarf-friend Athal at the vale of Nen Hilith. He has asked you to journey south-west to find him.\n",
[9868]="7003FC3E\n1\tFind Rodaglar in Morlad\tRodaglar can be found to the north of the entrance to Morlad. Belegant has asked you to speak to the people of Morlad in the hope that you can raise their morale.\n2\tRodaglar can be found to the north of the entrance to Morlad. You have found Rodaglar, and should now offer some gesture of hope to him.\t\n3\tFind Hirwë in Morlad\tHirwë can be found along the southern path in Morlad. Belegant has asked you to speak to the people of Morlad in the hope that you can raise their morale.\n4\tHirwë can be found along the southern path in Morlad. You have found Hirwë, and should now offer some gesture of hope to him.\t\n5\tFind Glorwen in Morlad\tGlorwen can be found near the top of Morlad along the northern path through the settlement. Belegant has asked you to speak to the people of Morlad in the hope that you can raise their morale.\n6\tGlorwen can be found near the top of Morlad along the northern path through the settlement. You have found Glorwen in Morlad, and should now offer some gesture of hope to her.\t\n7\tTalk to Belegant\tBelegant can be found on the second tier of Morlad in north-western Blackroot Vale. You have raised the spirits of the people of Morlad for the moment, and should now report your success to Belegant.\n",
[9869]="70056F61\n1\tExamine the axe Venko unpacked\030Examine the sword Venko unpacked\tVenko has unpacked a number of weapons from his belongings, and they have attracted your curiosity.\n2\tTalk to Venko at your camp-site in Misthallow\tVenko is at your camp-site in Misthallow.\n3\tLook at the Reikfoss of Greylin in memory of Venko's brothers\030Find the location to the north with a clear view of the Reikfoss waterfall\tVenko has asked you to look at the Reikfoss of Greylin to the north, in memory of his fallen brothers.\n4\tTalk to Venko at your camp-site in Misthallow\tVenko is at your camp-site in Misthallow.\n5\tDrink in silence, leaving Venko to his thoughts\tVenko has fallen silent. Perhaps you should drink in silence and leave him be for a time.\n6\tTalk to Glóin at your camp-site in Misthallow\030Talk to Imák at your camp-site in Misthallow\tGlóin and Imák are at your camp-site in Misthallow.\n",
[9870]="7002D066\n1\tThere is likely evidence of betrayal somewhere in the tower. You should collect any evidence you find in the tower.\t\n2\tTalk to Swithulf\tSwithulf is at the Eorlsmead Tower. You should speak with Swithulf and confirm the evidence you have collected.\n",
[9871]="7002D529\n1\tTalk to Éogar in the Horsefields\tÉogar may be found at Hengstacer Farm in the Horsefields of Bree, a bit north of Bree-town.\n",
[9872]="70071601\n1\tHarvest grass from outside Sormedân (total: 5)\030Collect buckets of water (total: 5)\tCollect grasses and water from the buckets in the fields just outside Sormedân.\n2\tProvide fresh grass to cattle in Sormedân (total: 5)\030Provide fresh water to cattle in Sormedân (total: 5)\tProvide fresh grass and water to injured cattle in Sormedân.\n3\tReturn to Lurâkha in Sormedân\tReturn to Lurâkha in Sormedân with your report on her cattle.\n",
[9873]="700683CE\n1\tCollect water buffalo hides ([see journal]/12)\tKhânai directed you to scour the lands surrounding the encampment but more near the savannah and desert for the water buffalo. You are to collect hides from the defeated beasts and return them to her at the expedition encampment.\n2\tTalk to Khânai\tWith the hides collected and safely stowed, it is time to return to the hunter's encampment outside of Umbar Baharbêl to deliver the hides to Khânai.\n",
[9874]="700359AB\n1\tForge a wrought iron ingot for the workers of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for a wrought iron ingot. You should forge a wrought iron ingot for the workers trying to rebuild after Núrzum's destruction.\n2\tDeliver the wrought iron ingot to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have forged a wrought iron ingot, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.\n",
[9875]="70037949\n1\tDefend the horses from enemy waves ([see journal]/6)\tProtect the horses at the stables from invading Orcs. If necessary, the horses can be set free to prevent them from being attacked. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9876]="7003A4A6\n1\tDefend the horses from enemy waves ([see journal]/7)\tProtect the steeds at the stables from the invading Orcs and Dunlendings. If necessary, the steeds can be manually released to prevent them from being attacked, but should only be done as a last resort.\n",
[9877]="700529AA\n1\tComplete 'Avabárg: Sunken Gloom'\030Complete 'Avabárg: Source of Gloom'\030Complete 'Avabárg: Buried Omens'\030Complete 'Avabárg: Wayward Bones'\tAudvak can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak.\n2\tTalk to Audvak\tAudvak can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Audvak.\n",
[9878]="700529A8\n1\tComplete 'Kidzul-kâlah: Dark Waters'\030Complete 'Kidzul-kâlah: Bonds of the Drowned'\030Complete 'Kidzul-kâlah: Battles Past'\030Complete 'Kidzul-kâlah: The Fallen'\tHithril can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Hithril.\n2\tTalk to Hithril\tHithril can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Hithril.\n",
[9879]="700571B7\n1\tCut down dead trees (total: 10)\030Gather wood from dead trees (total: 10)\tDead trees can be found in the Floodfells. You should cut down dead trees and gather the wood.\n2\tRepair broken palisades (total: 5)\tBroken palisades can be found in Limlók. You should repair the broken palisades.\n",
[9880]="7005299C\n1\tComplete 'Shathur-munzu: The Pack'\030Complete 'Shathur-munzu: Two Brothers'\030Complete 'Shathur-munzu: Caged'\030Complete 'Shathur-munzu: Wayward Herd'\tRagnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Ragnild.\n2\tTalk to Ragnild\tRagnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Ragnild.\n",
[9881]="70058352\n1\tConstruct barricades at Zudramdân (total: 8)\tPlaces to construct barricades can be found all around Zudramdân. You should assist in the construction of barricades.\n2\tCompleted\tAssisted in fortifying Zudramdân.\n",
[9882]="7005342A\n1\tComplete Protecting Shathur-munzu\tRagnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Ragnild.\n2\tComplete Protecting Shathur-munzu (total: 2)\tRagnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Ragnild.\n3\tTalk to Ragnild\tRagnild can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Ragnild.\n",
[9883]="7005342B\n1\tComplete Protecting Kidzul-kâlah\tHithril can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Hithril.\n2\tComplete Protecting Kidzul-kâlah (total: 2)\tHithril can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Hithril.\n3\tTalk to Hithril\tHithril can be found at Hultvís in Woodsedge. You should speak to Hithril.\n",
[9884]="7002BD4D\n1\tDefeat Saruman's forces in Fangorn\tDrive Saruman's forces from the eaves of Fangorn.\n",
[9885]="70037DAF\n1\tAllow the engineers to fortify the door ([see journal]/24)\030Destroy the battering ram\tThe gate-house at the entrance to the Hornburg must be held and fortified, lest the enemy take hold and create an easy entry point for their assault. The Rohirrim will help hold off the attacking Orcs, but the enemy will not cease while their battering ram still stands. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9886]="70071CD0\n1\tDefeat brigands at the Hold of Jalkhíla (total: 14)\tElder Jangâli has asked you to go to the Hold of Jalkhíla and deal with the band of thieving brigands harassing local townsfolk and those who pass by on the Great Road. The Hold of Jalkhíla can be found north of Sen Chatâk.\n2\tReturn to Jangâli in Sen Chatâk\tReturn to Jangâli in Sen Chatâk with news of your success.\n",
[9887]="7000EABA\n1\tDefeat Peikkos (total: 15)\tPeikkos can be found north of Ilmo, north of Sûri-kylä. Ilmo has asked you to drive off the Peikkos which threaten his herd.\n2\tTalk to Ilmo\tIlmo is outside of Sûri-kylä, north from its gates. You should return to Ilmo and tell him of your success against the Peikkos.\n",
[9888]="70020C36\n1\tDefeat creatures hunting the oxen of the Uch-lûth (total: 3)\tThe herds of the Uch-lûth range to the north-east of Uch Cadlus. Wunne has asked you to go among the herds of the Uch-lûth and protect them from wolves and other predators.\n2\tTalk to Wunne at Uch Cadlus\tWunne is at Uch-lûth in the Windfells of Enedwaith. You should return to Wunne with news of your success.\n",
})
